'''Lox''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Plains]]. They are an enlarged fusion of both a lizard and an ox, with shaggy brown hair and reptilian skin. Lox can be [[Taming|tamed]] which allows them to be bred and [[Lox Saddle|ridden]]. 

